flowchart TB
    App["Security Agent application repository<br/>Agent, API, CLI, engine and rules"]
    Plugin["Separate scanner-plugin repository<br/>mcp-assessment + skill-assessment"]
    Controls["Approved private configuration<br/>Versioned catalogue and mappings"]
    Plugin --> Marketplace["Corporate marketplace<br/>Distributes approved immutable plugin releases"]
    App --> CI
    Marketplace -->|selected pinned plugin| CI
    Controls -->|approved version references| CI
    CI["Application release CI<br/>Pin separate agent and plugin revisions<br/>Test compatibility and record artifact digests"]
    CI --> Image["Hosted release<br/>Immutable ECR image<br/>Agent, engine, scanner plugin and rules"]
    Image --> Hosted["Hosted execution<br/>AgentCore Runtime with API<br/>Explicit trusted skill loading"]
    CI --> Package["Local engine release<br/>Versioned engine package and CLI<br/>Compatible reviewed rules"]
    Package --> Local["Independent local execution<br/>Assistant loads pinned scanner plugin<br/>Invokes compatible local engine CLI"]
    Marketplace -->|same approved plugin| Local
    Local --> Report["Local report<br/>No AgentCore invocation required"]
